	Creating a circle out of squres and a square out of circles.
	Implemented a packing algorithm, where objects can also be inside others,
	but no overlapping.
	The size of the child objects reducing per iteration to better fit inside.

	Click on the sketch to switch between single and grid view.

	ToDo: implement padding between objects

	Join the Birb's Nest Discord for friendly creative coding community
